              "type": "string",
              "value": "Task: Retrieve the most relevant sections from the sales prioritization methodology document that apply to the given opportunity. Return only content needed to compute or explain the priority score, risks, actions, and tiers.\n\nOpportunity context for grounding: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_THE_CONTEXT.$output.output}} \n\nRetrieval instructions:\n\nReturn the exact snippets (with headings) that map to the required coverage above.\nInclude enough surrounding context to compute a score (e.g., full scoring tables or bullet lists).\nInclude all the exceptions, Special Instructions, Any specific instruction that might match with the opportunity.\nIf a factor from the opportunity context doesn’t map to the doc, state “No mapping found” for that factor."
            }
          ],
